- Hand off a whole capture or just the findings or meeting tasks you select. Copy capture files with their original screenshots.
- Regular and Small overlays are 15% narrower across capture modes.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:16:39 +0100</pubDate><sparkle:version>22</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.22</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/uid4oe/usefulwaves-releases/releases/download/v0.0.22/usefulwaves-0.0.22.dmg" length="5977387" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="yxly9hsl8Qyy9eJB/tCqEGAEz4QBlbp/5hNXUAgzvOU+MY0H4jP6b44OVv60ls1h03YNhFW2UM9lFLFRr7rFAA=="></enclosure><sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements></item><item><title>usefulwaves 0.0.23</title><description>Dictation checks the focused field, window, or Herdr pane before pasting. If delivery stops, choose Paste Again to retry pending content or Save Capture to keep the transcript and screenshots together. Recover Last Screenshot Paste in the menu bar restores images that an editor omitted. Retrying leaves the draft unsent.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:05:55 +0100</pubDate><sparkle:version>23</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.23</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/uid4oe/usefulwaves-releases/releases/download/v0.0.23/usefulwaves-0.0.23.dmg" length="5983075" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="XJRioIT8XgqxlnlRYl7LIVMILsYIOVhKmmu4oct77qZKYlp1SwZriZaFQPj/nHTiEIq1Axl0vpTOeb2XI+TXCw=="></enclosure><sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements></item><item><title>usefulwaves 0.0.24</title><description>Source builds, tests, and release packaging now keep temporary files and compiler caches on the configured build volume. Custom scratch locations remain supported.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:31:54 +0100</pubDate><sparkle:version>24</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.24</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/uid4oe/usefulwaves-releases/releases/download/v0.0.24/usefulwaves-0.0.24.dmg" length="5982379" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="9quORiq9HmKuiRY7eAj+2NigyZiG0YZuETNcy/b+p+cZpY0JM3hD8OQbLRXNhjZDJ5IttPzRbzhzq3DVuFawDA=="></enclosure><sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements></item><item><title>usefulwaves 0.0.25</title><description>- Refine a QA review’s summary in place. Open any finding to edit its title and description before handoff.
- Open screenshots in a larger viewer with Copy Screenshot and Close. Read the original transcript from the review.
- Choose Parakeet v2 in Speech Models for English-only transcription on Apple Silicon.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:45:02 +0100</pubDate><sparkle:version>25</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.25</sparkle:shortVersionString><sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion><enclosure url="https://github.com/uid4oe/usefulwaves-releases/releases/download/v0.0.25/usefulwaves-0.0.25.dmg" length="5999423" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="VprNQrcYSIXE9iBcrnKnEsJJBqwpgug9gi11/dYTG0j2a9lt4OH/t4x5jWuZlzb+ZvDBVijYmFp4DX31/RpwDg=="></enclosure><sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements></item></channel>
